  <data name="CurrentScope" xml:space="preserve"><value>Deployment, version changes, and clearing for ordinary files and offline ReShade; manual game entry and local scanning for Steam, GOG, Epic, EA, Xbox, Ubisoft, Battle.net, and Rockstar. ReShade supports DirectX 9, DirectX 10/11/12, and OpenGL. Automatic Vulkan ReShade management is excluded from v1; ordinary resources are unaffected. OptiScaler is copied as ordinary files; BAT files are not run.</value></data>
